manage project

Usage:
  mdql project [command]

Available Commands:
  add         create project
  archive     archive project
  decision    manage project/decision
  list        list project
  meeting     manage project/meeting
  milestone   manage project/milestone
  note        manage project/note
  show        show project
  update      update project

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for project

Global Flags:
  -f, --format string   output: table|json|csv|tsv
  -q, --quiet           IDs only
      --root string     store root (default ".")
      --schema string   schema file path (default "./schema.yml")

Use "mdql project [command] --help" for more information about a command.
